<DOCUMENT>
<TYPE>EX-99.1
<SEQUENCE>2
<FILENAME>ea028177201ex99-1.htm
<DESCRIPTION>NOTICE FOR THE SPECIAL GENERAL MEETING TO BE HELD ON MARCH 31, 2026
<TEXT>
<HTML>
<HEAD><TITLE></TITLE></HEAD>
<BODY STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;text-justify-trim: punctuation; margin: 0; padding: 10pt;"><DIV STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;width:600px;margin: 0 auto;">
	<DIV CLASS="_idGenObjectStyleOverride-1" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;border-width:0pt;">
		<P CLASS="H2" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;text-align:right;margin-top:12pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Exhibit 99.1</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="H2" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;text-align:left;margin-top:12pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;"><IMG ALT="" SRC="tbrenmiller_logo.jpg" STYLE="width:111.36px;max-width:100%;"></FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="H2" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Dear Brenmiller Energy Ltd. Shareholders:</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">We cordially invite you to attend the Special General Meeting of Shareholders of Brenmiller Energy Ltd. (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Company</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d;), to be held on March&#x00a0;31, 2026 at 10:00&#x00a0;a.m. Israel time, at the Company&#x2019;s office, located at 13 Amal St. 4</FONT><FONT CLASS="Superscript" STYLE="vertical-align:super;font-size:6pt;">th</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;"> Floor, Park Afek, Rosh Haayin, 4809249 Israel (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Meeting</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d;).</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">At the Meeting, shareholders will be asked to consider and vote on the matters listed in the enclosed Notice of Special General Meeting of Shareholders (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Notice</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d;).</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="H2" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-left:24pt;margin-top:12pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Our board of directors recommends that you vote&#x00a0;FOR&#x00a0;the Proposal listed in the Notice.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">Only shareholders of record at the close of business on March&#x00a0;19, 2026, (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Record Date</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d;), are entitled to notice of and to vote at the Meeting, either in person or by appointing a proxy to vote their shares at the Meeting as detailed in the Notice.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">We look forward to greeting as many of you as can attend the Meeting.</FONT></P>
		<TABLE CLASS="No-Table-Style" STYLE="width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px solid #000; border-width: 0pt; margin: 10pt 0 10pt 0;">


				<TR CLASS="No-Table-Style _idGenTableRowColumn-4" STYLE="height:12pt;">
